{"unit_id":"shangdi178__dsh-versions#card-zh","repo":"shangdi178/dsh-versions","commit":"b3e5dbdef8075e38e7672b87070c5191304e1463","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-versions 是 DSH Web 的主程序版本管理插件，在设置页提供版本总览、npm 更新检查、版本安装与升级历史。它注册本机 HTTP 接口并在设置中加入版本管理分区，可升级、降级或重装 DSH，升级前创建本地快照，并支持恢复快照、兼容性检查和兼容垫片管理。适合需要从 Web 界面维护 DSH 主程序的用户；版本检查会访问 npm registry，升级、恢复和重启引擎仅支持 Windows。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:870","lib/client.js:505"]}
{"unit_id":"shangdi178__dsh-versions#card-en","repo":"shangdi178/dsh-versions","commit":"b3e5dbdef8075e38e7672b87070c5191304e1463","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-versions manages the DSH host from web settings. It shows installed and published versions, checks npm releases, installs or rolls back a version, saves snapshots and history, and offers compatibility checks and shims. Registry checks use npm; upgrade and restart are Windows-only.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:870","lib/client.js:505"]}
