{"unit_id":"shangdi178__dsh-versions#feature-1","repo":"shangdi178/dsh-versions","commit":"b3e5dbdef8075e38e7672b87070c5191304e1463","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-versions 的功能「版本与发布列表」：在版本管理页查看当前 DSH 版本及 npm 发布版本和渠道，并向 npm registry 查询更新。通过设置页发起检查，界面展示发布版本和状态。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:570"]}
{"unit_id":"shangdi178__dsh-versions#feature-2","repo":"shangdi178/dsh-versions","commit":"b3e5dbdef8075e38e7672b87070c5191304e1463","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-versions 的功能「安装与升级」：可选择已发布版本执行升级、降级或重装；升级前保存本地快照，并显示可恢复的任务状态。用户在版本列表确认目标后启动操作。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:760"]}
{"unit_id":"shangdi178__dsh-versions#feature-3","repo":"shangdi178/dsh-versions","commit":"b3e5dbdef8075e38e7672b87070c5191304e1463","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-versions 的功能「快照恢复与兼容垫片」：列出本地版本快照并将其恢复到 DSH 安装目录；还可查看和管理针对旧 API 的兼容垫片。恢复或垫片操作从设置页触发。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/snapshot.js:136"]}
{"unit_id":"shangdi178__dsh-versions#caveat-1","repo":"shangdi178/dsh-versions","commit":"b3e5dbdef8075e38e7672b87070c5191304e1463","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-versions 使用前须知：版本查询向 registry.npmjs.org 或 registry.npmmirror.com 请求发布数据；升级、恢复和服务重启引擎依赖 Windows 工具，仅 Windows 可用。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:48","lib/index.js:22"]}
